@startuml AnySpark v4 - State Machine: Agent Loop
!theme plain
title AnySpark v4 — 状态机图：Agent 循环状态（Agent Loop State Machine）

[*] --> Idle : 初始化

state Idle {
  [*] --> WaitingInput
  WaitingInput --> BuildingPrompt : 收到 user_prompt
}

state Running {
  state "构建上下文" as BuildCtx
  state "调用模型" as CallModel
  state "解析输出" as ParseOutput
  state "执行工具" as ExecTools
  state "回填结果" as Backfill

  BuildCtx --> CallModel : prompt_messages 就绪
  CallModel --> ParseOutput : ModelOutput
  ParseOutput --> ExecTools : 有 tool_calls
  ParseOutput --> FinalAnswer : 无 tool_calls（终答）
  ExecTools --> Backfill : ToolResult(s)
  Backfill --> BuildCtx : 下一轮迭代

  state "压缩" as Compress
  BuildCtx --> Compress : 超预算阈值
  Compress --> BuildCtx : 压缩后消息
}

state FinalAnswer {
  [*] --> EmitText
  EmitText --> EmitDone
}

state ErrorState {
  [*] --> ModelFail
  ModelFail --> EmitError
}

state AbortedState {
  [*] --> CancelDetected
  CancelDetected --> EmitAborted
}

Idle --> Running : Agent.run()

Running --> Running : 工具迭代循环\n(max_tool_iterations)
Running --> FinalAnswer : 终答 / 全部 terminate
Running --> ErrorState : 模型调用失败\n(重试耗尽)
Running --> AbortedState : 用户取消\n(token.is_cancelled)

FinalAnswer --> [*] : Turn{text}
ErrorState --> [*] : Turn{error}
AbortedState --> [*] : Turn{已中断}

note right of Running
  **关键防护机制**：
  - 截断防护：truncated=True → 拒绝整批工具调用
  - 协作式取消：每轮/工具执行前检查
  - 异常平衡：模型调用失败不毒化上下文
  - 智能停止：全部 terminate → 提前结束
end note

note right of ExecTools
  **工具执行模式**：
  - parallel：默认并行（ThreadPoolExecutor）
  - sequential：批内任一工具标 sequential → 整批串行
  - before_tool_call 钩子：可拦截
  - after_tool_call 钩子：可改写结果
end note

@enduml
